'''Impotence''' is a [[debuff]] from the [[Trials of Chaos]] modifier "Occasional Impotence", which "You and your Minions deal no damage for 2 seconds every 8 seconds". It is also used by the similar {{c|mod|Players and their Minions deal no damage for 3 out of every 10 seconds}} [[map modifier]]. 

